      "hash": "7738b70282fe18c3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Coming up with nicknames is fun, but it’s not\\nso easy to do.\\c\\nClever names are nice, but simple names are\\neasier to remember."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t002r0201_system_01",
      "hash": "88f44e42859643ee",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You can change your Pokémon’s nickname from\\nthe [VAR COLOR(0006)]main menu[VAR COLOR(0000)]!\\c\\nJust view your party and choose the Pokémon\\nwith the name you want to change!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
